\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Represents a student with homework grades, an exam result, and computed final scores. 

\doxylink{classStudentas}{Studentas} (Lithuanian\+: "{}student"{}) inherits from \doxylink{classZmogus}{Zmogus} and extends it with academic data\+: a list of homework grades ({\ttfamily nd\+\_\+rez\+\_\+}), an exam result ({\ttfamily egz\+\_\+rez\+\_\+}), and two versions of the final grade — one based on the mean ({\ttfamily galutinis\+\_\+vid\+\_\+}) and one based on the median ({\ttfamily galutinis\+\_\+med\+\_\+}).

Final grade formula\+: 
\begin{DoxyCode}{0}
\DoxyCodeLine{galutinis\ =\ 0.4\ *\ (mean\ or\ median\ of\ nd\_rez\_)\ +\ 0.6\ *\ egz\_rez\_}

\end{DoxyCode}


Fully satisfies the Rule of Five, delegating base-\/class operations to \doxylink{classZmogus}{Zmogus}. 

